Upstream authors:
  Daniel H. Barch <daniel.barch@tufts.edu>
  Richard A. Chechile <richard.chechile@tufts.edu>
Upstream institution: Tufts University
Upstream source: https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=DFBA
CRAN publication date: 2023-12-13
Upstream licence: GPL-2 (GNU General Public License, version 2)

DFBA's DESCRIPTION declares GPL-2 and ships no separate licence file. This
port is a derivative work distributed under GPL-2.0-only; see LICENSE.

The upstream copyright notice and authorship above are preserved as required
by GPL-2 section 2(a). The Python implementation, API adaptations, result
helpers, and optional plotting layer are by the dfbayes contributors.

DFBA is not bundled in the installed Python package. Its source is vendored
read-only in the development repository under upstream/ solely as the
behavioural oracle for fixture generation.
